## 🔲 How to Generate & Share the QR Code for Mehbin

1. Open the website at **`http://localhost:3000`** in your browser.
2. Click **"Get Scannable QR Gift Card"** in the top bar or hero banner.
3. You will see the **Royal Princess QR Gift Card**:
   - High-contrast, scannable QR Code that leads directly to Mehbin's surprise.
   - Click **"Save QR Gift Card as Image (PNG)"** to download it as an image. Alfahad can send this image to Mehbin on WhatsApp, Instagram, or print it out on paper / greeting card!
   - When Mehbin points her phone camera at the QR code, the magical experience opens on her screen!

